        "original_id": "4e351600-c306-56b3-b6c6-ddf91737a7a4",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ricky Martin, Hank Osasuna\n- Songs: “Livin' la Vida Loca”, “Frío”\n- TV shows: Lemon La Vida Loca\n- Albums: Música + Alma + Sexo\n\nFacts:\n- In 1999, Ricky Martin released “Livin' la Vida Loca,” which became a number-one hit song.\n- Lemon La Vida Loca takes its title from Ricky Martin’s 1999 hit single “Livin' la Vida Loca.”\n- Hank Osasuna later appeared as Mad Paul in the ITV2 series Lemon La Vida Loca.\n- In 2011, Ricky Martin released “Frío” as the third single from the studio album Música + Alma + Sexo.",
